<title>Japan: New South Wales launches 5.45 pct yen/A$ samurais.</title>
<headline>New South Wales launches 5.45 pct yen/A$ samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's New South Wales Treasury Corp launched on Friday 20 billion yen worth of 5.45 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due on April 7, 2000, lead manager Yamaichi Securities said.</p>
<p>The bonds are priced at par, with coupon payments to be made twice a year.</p>
</text>
